-- MSW_HORIZONTAL: multisegment horizontal producer with spiral ICDs (C32, ResSim engine + OPM Flow / ECLIPSE)
--   * P1: 2700 ft horizontal producer in layer 2 (I = 2..19), 2.441 in tubing (WELSEGS: 18 tubing segments, INC)
--   * one device segment per connection (branches 2..19) with a spiral ICD (WSEGSICD) between the reservoir and the tubing
--   * a 2000 mD streak at the heel (I = 2..5) and a horizontal water injector below (layer 5): without ICDs the heel
--     produces most of the liquid and waters out first; the ICDs equalise the inflow along the well
--   * open Results -> Multisegment wells: segment pressure, flow, friction and device drops along the well
-- Variants for comparison: delete WSEGSICD (tubing friction only) or WELSEGS / COMPSEGS / WSEGSICD (standard well).
-- 20 x 3 x 5, FIELD units, dead oil + water
